<title>USA: TABLE-Cincinnati Financial Corp Q2 shr up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Cincinnati Financial Corp Q2 shr up.</headline>
<text>
<p>CINCINNATI, July 23 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.33		    $0.95</p>
<p> Net			 75,800		   54,400</p>
<p> Revs		     484,200		  442,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  57,500		   57,800</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
