<p> Revs		     967,900		  893,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  57,500		   57,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 net operating income per share, excluding net capital gains, was $1.11 vs $0.88.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
